activity Request Return
activity Approve Return
activity Generate Return Label
activity Ship Item Back
activity Receive Item
activity Inspect Item
activity Determine Refund
activity Process Refund
activity Restock Item
activity Dispose Item
bind Request Return: Return Status, Return Reason, Return ID
bind Approve Return: Return Status
bind Ship Item Back: Return Status, Days to Return, Shipping Method, Shipping Cost
bind Receive Item: Return Status
bind Inspect Item: Return Status, Item Condition, Inspection Result
bind Determine Refund: Return Status, Refund Amount
bind Process Refund: Return Status, Refund Amount
bind Restock Item: Return Status, Restock Quantity
bind Dispose Item: Return Status
Return Status: Requested, Approved, Rejected, Shipped, Received, Inspected, Refunded, Restocked, Disposed
Item Condition: integer between 1 and 5
Refund Amount: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Days to Return: integer between 1 and 60
Return Reason: Defective, Damaged, Wrong Item, No Longer Needed
Inspection Result: Acceptable, Damaged, Unacceptable
Restock Quantity: integer between 1 and 100
Shipping Cost: float between 0.0 and 50.0
Shipping Method: UPS, FedEx, USPS
Return ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Init[Request Return] | |
Response[Request Return, Approve Return] | | |0,24,h
Response[Approve Return, Generate Return Label] | | |0,30,m
Response[Generate Return Label, Ship Item Back] | | |
Response[Approve Return, Ship Item Back] | | |1,14,d
Response[Ship Item Back, Receive Item] | | |
Response[Receive Item, Inspect Item] | | |0,48,h
Response[Inspect Item, Determine Refund] | | |
Response[Determine Refund, Process Refund] | | |0,2,d
Response[Inspect Item, Restock Item] |A.Inspection Result is Acceptable | |
Response[Inspect Item, Dispose Item] |A.Inspection Result in (Damaged, Unacceptable) | |